Z||000000||Formula||09-28-2001||11:34 AM||||I was driving my neon though....<P>First race we pulled even all the way up to 50 then he shut down with me about a door length in front.<P>Second race, No rolling start this time, He got the jump off the line and pulled me until I hit 4k then I pulled on him a little bit until 6k and I shut down at his back bumper.<P>&lt;funny thing is, I only exceeded the speed limit by 5 mph lol&gt;<P>Also, this was no normal minivan, it was a guy in a suit driving it and it had magnetic signs on the side for a FLOWER company... <P>One of those moments went you wish you had the fiero.....<P>but it was a fun race, we were both laughing are a$$es off!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formulasigs.JPG"> ||||reg||1
