Z||000004||artherd||09-29-2001||01:43 AM||||Parents have a 94 caravan 'ES' with what is aparently a pretty rare 3.8litre v6.<P>The van goes pretty well, it will smoke it's tyres pretty easially, and is actually probally faster than my olde duke fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Gotta love racing mom's car!!!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000005||FieroHeather||09-29-2001||02:24 PM||||Are you sure that you werent racing me???!!!<P>My parents own a Caravan, we have magnetic signs on our van and we have a flowershop!  LOL  I dont wear suits, however, and Im not a guy.  Plus I dont live near ya...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I beat people all of the time with my van.  I love to smoke people off of the line (only when it is safe too, that is).  ||||reg||10
