Z||000007||Formula||09-30-2001||10:43 AM||||I think the minivan had a V6 though...<P>when he purged the nitrous I knew I was done, JK..<P>the neon isn't too bad of a car for what it is. 35 mpg highway, lots of cargo space (compard to my fiero).  The front is kind of cramped at first but you get used to it.<P>And it can hang with a minivan when it gets into the powerband.......yeeehaw!!!||||reg||1
